        PayslipDetail are under Payroll's grant (BOSS_PPL_PAYROLL: the payroll operator issues and corrects, the payroll approver reads).
        An employee's own issued payslips: a non-inheritable ALLOW on the shared MyPayslip screen (one location for both mounts,
        People/MyPayslip and Commons/People/MyPayslip), its statement's download, and the Mantle services it and SelfService's My
        payslips call, each of which admits the caller's own issued slips alone (find#Payslips with mine, get#MyPayslip, which takes no
        party). Nothing of payroll opens to them. The PayslipIssued notice (Mantle's topic, direct only, no amount) opens the slip under
        Commons, every self-service employee's mount. -->
    <artifactGroups artifactGroupId="BOSS_PPL_PAYSLIP_SELF" description="People own payslips for employees">
        <artifacts artifactName="component://mr-boss/screen/Shared/PeopleMyPayslip.xml" artifactTypeEnumId="AT_XML_SCREEN"
                inheritAuthz="N"/>
